---
import BookingButton from "@/components/BookingButton.astro";
---

<section id="hero" class="relative overflow-hidden bg-white">
  <div class="pointer-events-none absolute -top-32 right-[-8%] h-[28rem] w-[28rem] rounded-full bg-brand-100/50 blur-3xl" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="pointer-events-none absolute -bottom-24 left-[-10%] h-72 w-72 rounded-full bg-gold-100/40 blur-3xl" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <div class="relative mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-12 px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 lg:grid-cols-[1.08fr_0.92fr] lg:items-center lg:gap-14 lg:py-28 lg:px-8">
    <div class="order-1 min-w-0 text-center lg:text-left">
      <span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-brand-200 bg-brand-50 px-4 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-brand-700">
        PKV für Lehrer &amp; Referendare
      </span>

      <h1 class="mx-auto mt-7 max-w-[620px] hyphens-auto text-balance break-words text-[2.15rem] font-semibold leading-[1.1] tracking-tight text-ink-950 sm:text-5xl md:text-[3.4rem] lg:mx-0">
        Die passende PKV fürs Lehramt. <span class="text-brand-600">Weniger Recherche. Mehr Klarheit.</span>
      </h1>

      <div class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink-700/80 lg:mx-0">
        <p>
          Ich vergleiche geeignete PKV-Tarife und begleite dich bei den Gesundheitsfragen. So bekommst du eine
          verständliche Entscheidungsgrundlage, ohne dich allein durch Tarifunterlagen zu arbeiten.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-9 flex flex-col items-center gap-3 lg:items-start">
        <BookingButton location="hero" class="w-full sm:w-auto" />
        <p class="text-sm text-ink-700/60">15 Minuten · kostenlos &amp; unverbindlich</p>
      </div>

      <p class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-xl text-sm font-medium text-ink-700/70 lg:mx-0">
        Unabhängiger Versicherungsmakler · Persönlich in Kassel · Digital deutschlandweit
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="order-2 mx-auto w-full max-w-xs sm:max-w-sm lg:mx-0 lg:max-w-none">
      <div class="relative">
        <div
          class="pointer-events-none absolute -inset-5 -z-10 rounded-[2.25rem] bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-500/15 via-transparent to-gold-500/15 blur-xl"
          aria-hidden="true"
        >
        </div>
        <img
          src="/images/1-19.jpg"
          alt="Fabio Rumpf, Versicherungsmakler aus Kassel"
          class="aspect-[4/5] w-full rounded-[2.25rem] border border-black/5 object-cover shadow-2xl shadow-black/10"
          width="800"
          height="1000"
          fetchpriority="high"
        />
        <div
          class="absolute -bottom-5 -left-5 hidden rounded-2xl border border-black/5 bg-white px-5 py-4 shadow-lift sm:block"
          aria-hidden="true"
        >
          <p class="font-serif text-lg font-semibold text-ink-950">10+ Jahre</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-ink-700/60">Erfahrung als Makler</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
